# Nothing per-machine lives in this tree any more.
#
# Run directories, worktree handover files and the user's config all sit under
# $TEAMLEAD_HOME (default ~/.teamlead/) — see scripts/paths.py for why: `claude
# plugin update` replaces this directory, and a plugin someone else can install
# cannot carry one machine's briefs, repo paths and worktree names.
#
# What is left is local tool state only.
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
